    "Are the production rates in the table (e.g., Workshop A produces 10 units/hour of Component 1) the same for every workshop-component pair, meaning each workshop can produce any of the three components at the listed rate, or is each workshop restricted to producing only specific components?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the applicability of production rates to workshop-component pairs."
}

